    "review_summary": [
      "All 30 frozen scope file hashes match the scope exactly; the six active P3 profile definitions and eight action/profile links are included and match the addendum evidence.",
      "The one binding is powersword_p3 / powersword_p3_m1 with the exact bespoke trait and item restriction; UI display is 機械神教動力劍 布蘭克斯 Mk VI. Kind, map/reverse relation, and shared blessing rows agree.",
      "Own I-IV cooldowns are 5.5/4.5/3.5/2.5 seconds. The on-kill wrapper requires weakspot, active-special profile flag, exact attacking item and held slot. First eligible event can proc; the refund is +1 capped at 6 and a proc at cap still starts cooldown when the event is processed.",
      "Every activation consumes one charge and reschedules native recovery to activation time + 4s active duration + 1s native cooldown; later missing charges recover one per second. Refund and deactivation do not reset the native clock.",
      "The P3 inactive callback closes special mode while short-circuiting generic unwield charge clearing; offhand recovery and blessing cooldown continue, while held/item gates prevent other-weapon procs. Actual unequip removes the on-equip source.",
      "The four bilingual RAW reconstructions preserve the exact sentence and tier placeholder values. The previously reported duplicated reconstruction note was removed; canonical config, extension draft, resume receipt and final localization page are synchronized. Icon path, icon id and attachment URL remain separate and match the verified image receipt."
    ],
